'''January Gauntlet''' (1月強襲！, ''1 Gatsu Kyōshū ！'', '''January Assault!''') is a [[Gauntlet]] that only appears during January and was added in the [[Version 11.0 Update]]. It features enemies from the [[Happy New Year? (Monthly Event)|Happy New Year?]] event.

==Overview==
===About===
The January Gauntlet contains a total of 10 [[No Continues]] stages, called '''New Year? Lvs''' (おめ‥ Lvs.). After beating three stages, the player must wait for 90 minutes before they may proceed to the next one (30 minutes for one available). Rewards for the first completion of a New Year? Lv can include [[Battle Items]], one Platinum Fragment and [[Ototo Corps|Catamins]]. The rewards reset with every appearance of the event.

===Stage Battlegrounds===
:''See [[January Gauntlet/New Year? Lv.1~10]].''

==Play Requirements==
*January Gauntlet is unlocked after clearing [[Happy New Year? (Monthly Event)|Happy New Year?]].

